{
  "slug": "south-carolina-marathon",
  "title": "Run50 #第18州｜南卡罗莱纳：反“波士顿”马拉松｜小区绕圈20，世界上最无聊42公里？",
  "page": "/run50/wechat/south-carolina-marathon-modern-rail.html",
  "status": "pending",
  "entry_fix": false,
  "intro": "南卡罗莱纳小镇Greer的2Slow4Boston马拉松，一个专为跑不进波马的人准备的反向比赛。在宁静的小区里绕圈20次，收获一块骡子拉大叔的奇特奖牌。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/us-light-e54b43ad85bebd22.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-zh-index-south-carolina-cn-flat.jpg?v=20260701-stylemix-v1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "从北卡到南卡，春天的马拉松接力"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🏝️ Greer, SC</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">2月</strong>刚刚在北卡的橡树岛冲进大西洋，4月春风一吹，南卡也顺手安排上了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>说起来，南卡的马拉松真不好找。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">我们在跑步网站上翻来翻去</strong>，最后刷到一个特别有意思的名字：“2Slow4Boston”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "State-18 SC @Arsenan",
      "alt": "State-18 SC "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>乍一看像个 “整活” 比赛，谐音梗玩得飞起（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">Too Slow</strong> for Boston，进不了波士顿），</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>结果一查，还真不是开玩笑。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">这比赛正经有点东西</strong>：</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>专为“跑不进波士顿的人”准备，反其道而行，越慢越光荣。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">甚至还会把奖杯颁给最后三个完赛的跑者</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>主打一个慢下来、享受、别内耗。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">说实话我当时还犹豫了好一阵</strong>，感觉这比赛也太“无聊”了,</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑个马拉松，要在一个小区里绕<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">20圈</strong>，风景是树、房子、草坪三件套循环播放。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>但想着4月底还要跑肯塔基的 Derby 马拉松，就当做赛前训练吧，轻松点，不争配速，顺带还能把 Run50 的南卡打个卡，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">我们就这么出发了</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "State-18 SC @Siqi",
      "alt": "State-18 SC @Siqi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "南卡罗莱纳：安静又低调，历史老灵魂"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🌿Greer, NC</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>南卡罗莱纳，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Run50</strong> 的第18州。从地图上看，它紧贴着北卡，藏在美国东南角。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>州不大，存在感不强，但别看它现在安静，历史上却一点都不安分：<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">美国内战的第一枪</strong>，就是从这儿打响的南部邦联在这里喊出了 “我要退群” 的第一声。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "State-18 SC@Siqi",
      "alt": "State-18 SC@Siqi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>可以说，是美国历史里那个总想第一个站出来发言的学生：</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>首府哥伦比亚（Columbia）名气不大，游客稀少；</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最大城市查尔斯顿（Charleston）是个老港口城市，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">有点小资情调</strong>，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我们这次落脚的 <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">Greer</strong>，是个贴着北卡边界的小镇，既不靠海，也不靠热闹。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>总之，南卡不像佛州那样阳光炸裂，也没有北卡海岸线的诗意，但它作为 Run<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">50</strong> 的第18站，也足够有分量</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "路过大烟山，Airbnb是辆大房车！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🌿Greer, NC</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>一路从北卡往南卡开，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">穿过大烟山脚下的时候</strong>，我们在一个阳光明媚的小镇 Pigeon Forge （皮金福奇） 停了一下，吃了顿正宗美式自助 Golden Corral</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "Pigeon Forge @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Pigeon Forge "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "Pigeon Forge · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Pigeon Forge "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "Pigeon Forge · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Pigeon Forge "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "Golden Corral @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Golden Corral "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>下午到达<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">Greer</strong> 小镇，这里就是我们参加 2Slow4Boston 的比赛地点。装备领取点非常特别，不在什么会展中心，而是主办方家的前廊。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">我们一走过去</strong>，看到老板娘穿着扎染T恤，坐在一张高脚桌后面，桌上铺着一沓黄色T恤和号码布，旁边是一个老爷爷，背后是自家房子。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>整个氛围不像比赛现场，更像是社区家庭日，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">邻居们随手办了个跑团活动</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "Greer @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Greer "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "Greer · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Greer "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "Jersey @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Jersey "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "Expo @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Expo "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>衣服是亮眼的波士顿配色：黄+蓝，胸口图案是个老哥拖着一头不想动的骡子，主题呼之欲出：<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Too Slow</strong> 4 Boston（慢到进不了波马！）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>领完装备，我们开车去了这次订的 Airbnb。说实话，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">这地方比我预期帅太多</strong>：是辆停在草地上的大房车（拖挂式 RV）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这种没有驾驶室的房车，通常靠皮卡拖着走，美国人特别爱，假期拖着家走天涯，到了地儿一停，房车一展开，比我租的公寓都大，洗澡、做饭、看电视一样不落。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "Jersey · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Jersey "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "RV Airbnb @Arsenan",
      "alt": "RV Airbnb "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "RV Airbnb @Hover",
      "alt": "RV Airbnb @Hover"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "RV Airbnb @Hover · 2",
      "alt": "RV Airbnb @Hover"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我特别喜欢奥斯卡最佳影片《Nomadland（无依之地）》，讲的就是一群住在房车里、在美国各地打零工的游牧人。他们有点苦、有点孤独，但也特别自由。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我常想，要是以后能有点小钱，买辆房车，跟Siqi一起跑完50州再去国家公园露营，那得多酷啊。（当然啦，有房车就不算露营了，那算开着小别墅在野外横着走。）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "RV Airbnb @Hover · 3",
      "alt": "RV Airbnb @Hover"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "RV Airbnb · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "RV Airbnb "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "RV Airbnb · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "RV Airbnb "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "RV Airbnb · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "RV Airbnb "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这辆房车里应有尽有，就是卫生间晚上堵了。我们俩忙活半天搞不定，最后只好打电话给房东。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>结果房东从隔壁的超大house走了过来，三下五除二帮我们搞定，我们也借此跟房东打了个照面。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑马之前的这个晚上，有点像开着移动小家，把南卡打卡成了自己的后院。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "最慢才有奖：这场马拉松，有点反着来！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🌿Greer, SC</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>马拉松圈子里，从来都崇尚“快”，跑得快是实力，是荣誉，是被 BQ 选中的人的勋章。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>但在南卡小镇 Greer，这场叫 2Slow4Boston 的马拉松，却反其道而行之。它不崇拜快，而是致敬“慢”。甚至明文规定：跑太快的，没资格领奖。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛的象征不是独角兽，而是“骡子”，因为这场比赛，拼的不是速度，而是倔强。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这场马拉松的起源，也很特别。它最初是另一个比赛系列 B. Marathon 的支线。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>发起人想了个有趣的点子：“既然波马是所有人的目标，那我们办个反向的，不如办个 Too Slow for Boston（太慢上不了波士顿）的比赛？”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这才有了如今的 2S4B。一个既有梗又有深意的小圈马拉松。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston Google · 资料图",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston @Google"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>整场比赛调性和传统马拉松完全不同。官网上写得很直白：“我们相信，花6、7、<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">8小时</span>完成一场马拉松，那种不放弃的倔强，也值得掌声。”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>补给区也很 “社区风”：只有一个点，提供薯片、三明治、汽水，还有午饭披萨。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>所以这也许就是世界上那个最无聊的马拉松！但越了解它，就觉得：这个奇葩的比赛，好像还有那么点意思。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "迟到半小时也没事，反正主打一个慢！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🌿Greer, SC</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛日清晨，我们从房车里出发，回到昨天那个取装备的小区，准备开始今天的“绕圈圈”挑战。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这场比赛的跑法很简单也很硬核：一个小区，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">1.31英里</span>一圈，跑20圈，完事。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>阳光还没毒辣，但南卡的早晨已经有点燥热了。我们一边聊着天一边晃到赛道起点，忽然看到好些人已经在路上来回穿梭了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我心想：这群人也太积极了吧，热身跑得跟正式比赛似的！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>结果定睛一看，人家比赛已经开始了！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我们居然迟到半小时了！但说真的，完全没人管你什么时候开始，毕竟这比赛叫“Too Slow for Boston”，慢才是美德，谁快谁尴尬。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我慢悠悠地上了个厕所，再慢悠悠地从那个唯一的绿色拱门出发。整个氛围像极了周末在自家小区里晨跑，一点都不紧张。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这个社区不大，但路还真不是全平，有些起伏坡度。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑者其实不多，居民更是几乎看不到几个，现场气氛安静到能听见脚步声和自己喘气。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最热情的观众，其实是：一只狗。它站在栅栏后面，眼巴巴地看着我们跑来跑去，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "Miami Bus @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Miami Bus "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>补给点就一个，主办方提倡自带水杯，环保还自律。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我没有带水袋，就厚着脸皮，要了好几个塑料瓶，每圈路过时我都把它放在一个阴凉角落，变成我专属的“秘密补给点”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>随着圈数增加，天气开始发狠，南卡的太阳也不是盖的，没几圈，我就感受到皮肤开始“烤熟”的感觉，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 7 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 8 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 9 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Siqi今天状态超好，不急不躁，稳步推进，一路慢步前行。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我每次跑过那个绿色拱门，都会有个志愿者拿着计数器替我点数，像打卡上班一样。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 10 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 11 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛道上还有个很扎眼的哥们，戴着美国国旗头巾，打着赤膊，肌肉一块一块，跑得飞快，算是全场第二亮的仔。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>不过从我的 “数据观测” 来看，这场比赛的参赛阵容，主力还是：老头老太太居多。真慢不过他们，Respect！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 12 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 13 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 14 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 15 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛过程中偶尔也能蹭到点阴凉，但大部分赛道都暴露在烈日下，没几圈就能把人烤熟。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我那个“秘密补给点”也开始堆积了战利品，塑料瓶一瓶接一瓶，搞得像个饮料展览角，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 16 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 17 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 18 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 19 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>估计补给站大妈看到得直接破防，心里一定在嘟囔：“不是说让你们自带水杯吗？你这搞的是个塑料瓶自助站？”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>电解质水是轮番上的，紫色、粉色、黄色、花里胡哨的颜色轮番轰炸，味道有点像小时候泡泡糖水，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>但说真的，在这种无聊又安静的赛道上，这点颜色和糖精，可以增添点趣味。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 20 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 21 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 22 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>太阳越来越毒，影子被晒得笔直笔直的，我一低头，看到自己的脸都快熟了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后几英里时，我在补给点碰到了Siqi，她状态不错，还能一边走一边笑嘻嘻地拍照。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 23 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 24 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 25 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>组委会的大叔也凑上来聊天，看到我手上的相机问我：“这是GoPro？”我说：“不，是DJI。” 他挠头笑了笑：“我那台老相机都快成古董了，估计没你的好”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Siqi还顺手帮我拿了一会儿相机，让我轻松了不少。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 26 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 27 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 28 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "caption": "Siqi @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Siqi "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>等我们下一次会面，她已经跑完了，手里还多了个“慢奖”奖杯。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>很不错，非常符合Siqi的人设。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 29 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 30 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我这边也终于跑到最后一个 <em>loop</em>，作为一个有素质的跑者，我没有留下满地塑料瓶“作品展”，而是回到那个角落，把所有瓶子收拾干净，一股脑扔进垃圾桶。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后冲线的时候，那个戴眼镜的组委会大妈在拱门下等着我，亲手把奖牌给我挂上，还拍拍我肩膀，说了句“Nice job！”</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 31 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 32 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 33 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 34 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 35 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>那一刻，我真的感觉赛期低估了这个小比赛，跑完还挺不容易的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>后来我们还在另一场马拉松又遇到了这位大妈，真是“跑者何处不相逢”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-058.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 36 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-059.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 37 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-060.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 38 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-061.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 39 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-062.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston @DaMa",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston @DaMa"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛后天气热得要命，我猛灌水，还吃了两片披萨，和Siqi拍了不少合照，整个人就像晒干的咸鱼，被奖牌重新复活。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这块奖牌外形酷似波士顿马拉松的那个金灿灿的独角兽，但定睛一看，不是独角兽，而是大胡子人拉着一头死活不动的骡子！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-063.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston @Siqi",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston @Siqi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-064.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston @Siqi · 2",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston @Siqi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-065.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston @DaMa · 2",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston @DaMa"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-066.webp",
      "caption": "2Slow4Boston · 40 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2Slow4Boston "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>挺有意思的，马拉松有的人跑得像骏马，有的人拖着骡子也要到终点，我们是后者，但我们也到啦！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "你瞅啥？慢点咋的啦？！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>🌿Greer, SC</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛结束后，我们<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">马不停蹄</span>地开车回肯塔基，路上还顺手解决了一顿 KPot 韩国自助火锅。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-South-Carolina-Marathon-clean_files/img-067.webp",
      "caption": "K-Pot @Arsenan",
      "alt": "K-Pot "
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>回头想想，这可能是我跑过最“佛系”的一场马拉松：没有起跑枪；没有配速兔；没有观众呐喊；也没有终点前必须全力冲刺的紧张感。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>有的只是一个小社区，一圈又一圈，无限循环。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>有时候，跑步即修行：不能着急，不能抄近路，也不能太在意别人快慢。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这场叫 2Slow4Boston 的比赛，名字听起来像在开玩笑，</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>可它的内核，其实很认真。它是在告诉我们这些普通跑者：“你跑得慢没关系，重要的是你还在跑。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>第18州 · South Carolina · Check！</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>从南卡到肯塔基，我们穿过了一条又一条阳光斑驳的公路。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>车窗外，是南卡典型的乡村风光；车窗里，是我们挂在脖颈上的一块小小奖牌。它不是波士顿的独角兽，但也闪着金光，好像在说啊：</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑者不只有波士顿那一条路。有时候，绕二十圈的社区，也能跑出自己的节奏和荣耀。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>/ Slow Slow Slow @Arsenan</p>"
    }
  ]
}